enchilada: display off/on without panel sleep (boot64 showed noise after wake); MAX98927 REV_ID 0x4x

boot64: lock sent 0x28 + 0x10, unlock 0x11 + 0x29 (all acked) and restarted autorefresh, but the panel never showed another frame (its frame memory, random, on screen while the MDP flipped in place): Linux's sofef00 re-sends tear-on and its init after sleep out. Display off/on now only sends 0x28/0x29 (the AMOLED's pixels go off; the panel keeps its state); sweetbl=2 adds sleep in/out as before. The amp on this phone reads REV_ID 0x42; Linux only logs it, so any 0x4x passes now.

